  "question": {
    "text": "The tangent drawn to the hyperbola <math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math> at point <math><mi>P</mi></math> in the first quadrant whose abscissa is <math><mn>5,</mn></math>&nbsp;meets the lines <math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> at <math><mi>Q</mi></math> and <math><mi>R</mi></math> respectively. If <math><mi>O</mi></math> is the origin, then the area of triangle <math><mi>O</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi></math> is (in square units)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "FNUE6",
      "text": "<math><mn>6</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
